WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.480
- But I'm very, very
excited, and so is Rubin,

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.630
who loves superhero stuff more
than me and all this stuff.

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:06.260
So, we are excited about "The Batman."

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:07.093
So...

00:00:07.093 --> 00:00:08.049
(audience cheering)

00:00:08.049 --> 00:00:09.711
We're excited.

00:00:09.711 --> 00:00:11.810
So what can you tell us about it?

00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:13.200
You play Penguin.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:14.410
- I play, yeah.

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:15.453
I play Oz,

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:17.890
who's kind of,

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:19.760
hasn't embodied the penguin yet,

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:22.040
but is known as The Penguin
basically because he has a bit

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:24.933
of an awkward gait,

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:27.330
and yeah.

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:28.870
It was ama...

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:30.627
Oh yeah, there is it.

00:00:30.627 --> 00:00:33.930
A really extraordinary makeup
artist called Mike Marino,

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:35.280
kind of designed the character.

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:36.660
I will say I can...
- Wait, wait, what?

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:38.590
Wait, that's not you though.

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:39.423
- Yeah.

00:00:39.423 --> 00:00:40.256
- Wait, what?

00:00:40.256 --> 00:00:41.791
- Yeah.

00:00:41.791 --> 00:00:42.624
- Wait, what?

00:00:42.624 --> 00:00:44.210
(audience laughing)

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.926
I didn't see that picture.

00:00:45.926 --> 00:00:47.075
Oh, my God.
- [Colin] You didn't, really?

00:00:47.075 --> 00:00:47.908
- [Kelly] I just heard
that you were Penguin.

00:00:47.908 --> 00:00:48.741
What the hell?

00:00:48.741 --> 00:00:49.574
- [Colin] Oh, you haven't seen that?

00:00:49.574 --> 00:00:50.430
- [Kelly] That person
deserves to win awards.

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:51.650
- [Colin] Oh no, no, no, he should.

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:53.376
Yeah, yeah.
(audience clapping)

00:00:53.376 --> 00:00:54.209
- [Kelly] That's you?

00:00:54.209 --> 00:00:55.145
- No, it's amazing.

00:00:55.145 --> 00:00:58.561
It's amazing what he was, and
he designed the whole thing.

00:00:58.561 --> 00:00:59.790
- I couldn't download
the photo last night,

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:00.623
and I kept telling her, I was like,

00:01:00.623 --> 00:01:01.610
I never saw him as Penguin.

00:01:01.610 --> 00:01:02.443
- It's amazing.

00:01:02.443 --> 00:01:03.276
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:03.276 --> 00:01:05.530
- The first time I saw the makeup was,

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:08.910
they had done a, he had done a mold of

00:01:11.431 --> 00:01:14.380
my face and I saw it on a screen.

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:16.580
Matt Reeves' screen the director,

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:18.120
the writer-director of The Batman.

00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:20.290
He said do you wanna see
what Mike Marino's done?

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:21.770
What he thinks Oz is gonna look like?

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:22.603
And I said, yeah.

00:01:22.603 --> 00:01:23.470
And he showed me the screen.

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:25.210
I just, I didn't know it
was going in that direction.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:27.010
And I went, holy smoke.

00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:29.160
And I'd never done
anything like that before.

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:30.160
And I can't claim...

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:31.330
- What kind of time did
it take to look like that?

00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:32.572
- Four hours, four hours.

00:01:32.572 --> 00:01:33.530
(gasps) I complain about...

00:01:33.530 --> 00:01:34.770
At the start four hours

00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:37.300
and then they got it down
to two and it was fine.

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:39.690
'Cause I knew the reward was immense.

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:40.523
And it was...

00:01:40.523 --> 00:01:41.356
- You're a different human.

00:01:41.356 --> 00:01:43.522
- It was extraordinary, Kelly.

00:01:43.522 --> 00:01:45.170
It was so liberating.
- Did you ever go out in that?

00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:47.430
- No, we did...
- I would've gone out in that.

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:48.263
- We did a test.

00:01:48.263 --> 00:01:50.690
- And then talk (beep)
about Colin Ferrell.

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:52.005
(laughs)

00:01:52.005 --> 00:01:52.838
- I would have been you.

00:01:52.838 --> 00:01:53.720
- See how people really feel.

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:55.010
Until you find out they're like, sorry,

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:56.030
never heard of him.

00:01:56.030 --> 00:01:57.123
Oh, checked ego.

00:01:58.033 --> 00:01:59.156
(audience clapping)

00:01:59.156 --> 00:02:00.367
- That would have been
what I would have done.

00:02:00.367 --> 00:02:02.700
- That experiment backfired.

00:02:04.512 --> 00:02:05.345
- It was amazing.
- That's crazy.

00:02:05.345 --> 00:02:06.710
Yeah, so I can,

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:11.710
I've never been able
to take less ownership

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:15.410
over a performance in my life.

00:02:15.410 --> 00:02:17.783
- Yeah, it's like so physically different.

00:02:17.783 --> 00:02:22.690
- It's like, I don't know if
it's like 50-50, 49-51, 60-40.

00:02:22.690 --> 00:02:24.160
I'm not sure.
- Oh my gosh.

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:27.550
But Mike Marino and myself and
then Matt of course wrote it.

00:02:27.550 --> 00:02:28.383
You know, it's,

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:31.183
you didn't have to do much.

00:02:31.183 --> 00:02:32.255
- So intense.

00:02:32.255 --> 00:02:33.088
It was like an alchemy, yeah.

00:02:33.088 --> 00:02:34.040
When it went on the first time

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:37.360
and just you're hidden and you
just have absolute freedom.

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:39.883
- Oh my God, I will never
complain about spanks again.

00:02:39.883 --> 00:02:41.501
(laughs)

00:02:41.501 --> 00:02:43.673
- Having it on four hours, so it's a lot.

